WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.246
An agent needs a payment that is instant, cheap and needs no registration.

2
00:00:05.246 --> 00:00:09.480
The x402 protocol uses the old response code “payment required”:

3
00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:14.839
the service names a price, the agent repeats the request with a signed stablecoin

4
00:00:14.839 --> 00:00:17.618
payment, and the service returns the data.

5
00:00:17.618 --> 00:00:18.478
Alongside it:

6
00:00:18.478 --> 00:00:22.646
mandates signed by a human, and registries of agent reputation.
